<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: beaver dam -->
  <AEXP_BeaverDam.label>海狸壩</AEXP_BeaverDam.label>
  <!-- EN: Beaver dams or beaver impoundments are dams built by beavers to provide ponds as protection against predators such as coyotes, wolves, and bears, and to provide easy access to food during winter. -->
  <AEXP_BeaverDam.description>海狸壩或海狸蓄水池是由海狸建造的堤壩，用以保護水塘，以抵禦野狼、狼和熊等掠食者，並在冬季方便其獲取食物。</AEXP_BeaverDam.description>
  
</LanguageData>